 int dp(float x){return (int)(x*getResources().getDisplayMetrics().density+.5f);} TextView txt(String s,int sp,int color){TextView t=new TextView(this);t.setText(s);t.setTextColor(color);t.setTextSize(sp);t.setPadding(dp(7),dp(5),dp(7),dp(5));return t;} LinearLayout column(){LinearLayout l=new LinearLayout(this);l.setOrientation(1);return l;} LinearLayout row(){LinearLayout l=new LinearLayout(this);l.setOrientation(0);return l;} void add(LinearLayout parent,View child,int w,int h){parent.addView(child,new LinearLayout.LayoutParams(w<0?w:dp(w),h<0?h:dp(h)));} void weight(LinearLayout p,View v,float w){p.addView(v,new LinearLayout.LayoutParams(0,-1,w));} void panel(LinearLayout l){l.setBackgroundColor(PANEL);l.setPadding(dp(8),dp(8),dp(8),dp(8));} String f(double v){return Double.isFinite(v)?String.format(java.util.Locale.US,"%,.4f",v):"--";}
 @Override public void onCreate(Bundle b){super.onCreate(b);getWindow().getDecorView().setSystemUiVisibility(5894|1024|512);build();refresh();}
 void build(){root=column();root.setBackgroundColor(BG);setContentView(root);LinearLayout header=row();header.setBackgroundColor(0xff101b2d);add(root,header,-1,46);add(header,txt("◈ BYBIT FUTURES  |  PREMIUM v3.0",17,WHITE),-2,-1);status=txt("● 데이터 연결 중",11,GOLD);add(header,status,-2,-1);LinearLayout content=row();root.addView(content,new LinearLayout.LayoutParams(-1,0,1));watch=column();panel(watch);add(content,watch,164,-1);main=column();panel(main);weight(content,main,5);side=column();panel(side);add(content,side,235,-1);renderWatch();LinearLayout top=row();add(main,top,-1,49);priceLabel=txt(symbol+"  --",21,WHITE);add(top,priceLabel,-2,-1);TextView tf=txt("시간봉 변경: 1m 3m 5m 15m 1h 4h 1D",10,MUTED);add(main,tf,-1,26);LinearLayout tabs=row();add(main,tabs,-1,35);for(String x:new String[]{"1","3","5","15","60","240","D"}){TextView b=txt(x.equals("D")?"1일":x+"분",11,x.equals(interval)?GOLD:WHITE);tabs.addView(b,new LinearLayout.LayoutParams(0,-1,1));b.setOnClickListener(v->{interval=x;refresh();});}chart=new Chart(this);main.addView(chart,new LinearLayout.LayoutParams(-1,0,1));metrics=txt("EMA / RSI / ATR 분석 대기",11,MUTED);add(main,metrics,-1,39);signal=txt("AI 매매 판단  |  WAIT",19,GOLD);add(side,signal,-1,50);longPlan=txt("LONG 전략 계산 중",12,GREEN);add(side,longPlan,-1,-2);shortPlan=txt("SHORT 전략 계산 중",12,RED);add(side,shortPlan,-1,-2);reason=txt("데이터 수신 후 분석 근거를 표시합니다.",11,MUTED);add(side,reason,-1,-2);add(side,txt("※ 연구용 조건부 전략. 체결 보장 없음.\n실시간 주문·자동매매 기능 없음.\n뉴스·OI·펀딩비·호가 미연결: 진입 확정 불가.",10,GOLD),-1,-2);}
 void renderWatch(){watch.removeAllViews();add(watch,txt("MARKETS",15,WHITE),-1,37);for(String s:symbols){TextView t=txt("● "+s.replace("USDT","")+" / USDT",12,s.equals(symbol)?GOLD:WHITE);add(watch,t,-1,37);t.setOnClickListener(v->{symbol=s;refresh();renderWatch();});}}
 void refresh(){status.setText("● Bybit 데이터 요청 중");final String sym=symbol,tf=interval;pool.execute(()->{try{String json=get("https://api.bybit.com/v5/market/kline?category=linear&symbol="+sym+"&interval="+tf+"&limit=200");JSONObject r=new JSONObject(json);if(r.getInt("retCode")!=0)throw new Exception(r.optString("retMsg"));JSONArray data=r.getJSONObject("result").getJSONArray("list");ArrayList<Candle> c=new ArrayList<>();for(int i=data.length()-1;i>=0;i--)c.add(new Candle(data.getJSONArray(i)));String tick=get("https://api.bybit.com/v5/market/tickers?category=linear&symbol="+sym);JSONObject tr=new JSONObject(tick);double price=Double.parseDouble(tr.getJSONObject("result").getJSONArray("list").getJSONObject(0).getString("lastPrice"));handler.post(()->{if(!sym.equals(symbol)||!tf.equals(interval))return;candles=c;lastPrice=price;updated=System.currentTimeMillis();calculate();chart.invalidate();status.setText("● REST 갱신 "+new java.text.SimpleDateFormat("HH:mm:ss",Locale.KOREA).format(new Date(updated)));priceLabel.setText(sym+"  $"+f(price));});}catch(Exception e){handler.post(()->{status.setText("● 데이터 오류 / WAIT");signal.setText("WAIT · 데이터 연결 실패");reason.setText("API 오류: "+e.getMessage()+"\n연결 확인 후 새로고침하세요.");});}});}
 static String get(String url)throws Exception{HttpURLConnection con=(HttpURLConnection)new URL(url).openConnection();con.setConnectTimeout(9000);con.setReadTimeout(9000);con.setRequestProperty("User-Agent","BybitPremiumV3/1.0");try(InputStream in=con.getInputStream();ByteArrayOutputStream out=new ByteArrayOutputStream()){byte[] b=new byte[4096];int n;while((n=in.read(b))!=-1)out.write(b,0,n);return out.toString("UTF-8");}finally{con.disconnect();}}
 double ema(int n){if(candles.size()<n)return Double.NaN;double e=0;for(int i=0;i<n;i++)e+=candles.get(i).c;e/=n;double k=2.0/(n+1);for(int i=n;i<candles.size();i++)e=candles.get(i).c*k+e*(1-k);return e;}
 double rsi(){int n=candles.size();if(n<16)return Double.NaN;double g=0,l=0;for(int i=n-14;i<n;i++){double d=candles.get(i).c-candles.get(i-1).c;g+=Math.max(0,d);l+=Math.max(0,-d);}return l==0?100:100-100/(1+g/l);}
 double atr(){int n=candles.size();if(n<16)return Double.NaN;double a=0;for(int i=n-14;i<n;i++){Candle c=candles.get(i);double prev=candles.get(i-1).c;a+=Math.max(c.h-c.l,Math.max(Math.abs(c.h-prev),Math.abs(c.l-prev)));}return a/14;}
 void calculate(){if(candles.size()<60||!Double.isFinite(lastPrice)){signal.setText("WAIT · 데이터 부족");return;}double e20=ema(20),e50=ema(50),r=rsi(),a=atr();double low=Double.MAX_VALUE,high=-Double.MAX_VALUE,vol=0;int n=candles.size();for(int i=n-40;i<n;i++){Candle c=candles.get(i);low=Math.min(low,c.l);high=Math.max(high,c.h);vol+=c.v;}double avgVol=vol/40;Candle now=candles.get(n-1);boolean bull=e20>e50,bear=e20<e50,volOk=now.v>avgVol*1.15;longP=new Plan();shortP=new Plan();longP.entry=low+a*.20;longP.sl=low-a*.55;double riskL=longP.entry-longP.sl;longP.tp1=longP.entry+riskL*1.5;longP.tp2=longP.entry+riskL*2.5;longP.rr=1.5;shortP.entry=high-a*.20;shortP.sl=high+a*.55;double riskS=shortP.sl-shortP.entry;shortP.tp1=shortP.entry-riskS*1.5;shortP.tp2=shortP.entry-riskS*2.5;shortP.rr=1.5;boolean nearLong=Math.abs(lastPrice-longP.entry)<=a*.45,nearShort=Math.abs(lastPrice-shortP.entry)<=a*.45;boolean longConfirm=nearLong&&r<48&&now.c>now.o&&volOk;boolean shortConfirm=nearShort&&r>52&&now.c<now.o&&volOk;longP.state=longConfirm?"조건 일부 충족 · 추가 검증 필요":nearLong?"도달 · 반등 확인 대기":"진입 가격 대기";shortP.state=shortConfirm?"조건 일부 충족 · 추가 검증 필요":nearShort?"도달 · 매도 확인 대기":"진입 가격 대기";signal.setText("AI 판단: WAIT");longPlan.setText("▲ LONG 후보\n진입 "+f(longP.entry)+"\nTP1 "+f(longP.tp1)+"  TP2 "+f(longP.tp2)+"\nSL "+f(longP.sl)+"\n위험 "+String.format(Locale.US,"%.2f%%",riskL/longP.entry*100)+" | R:R 1:1.5\n"+longP.state);shortPlan.setText("▼ SHORT 후보\n진입 "+f(shortP.entry)+"\nTP1 "+f(shortP.tp1)+"  TP2 "+f(shortP.tp2)+"\nSL "+f(shortP.sl)+"\n위험 "+String.format(Locale.US,"%.2f%%",riskS/shortP.entry*100)+" | R:R 1:1.5\n"+shortP.state);metrics.setText("EMA20 "+f(e20)+"   EMA50 "+f(e50)+"   RSI14 "+String.format(Locale.US,"%.1f",r)+"   ATR14 "+f(a));reason.setText("분석 근거\n추세: "+(bull?"EMA 상승 배열":bear?"EMA 하락 배열":"중립")+"\nRSI14: "+String.format(Locale.US,"%.1f",r)+"\n거래량: "+(volOk?"평균 대비 증가":"확인 부족")+"\n최근 40봉 고저점과 ATR 기반 후보\n※ 가격 도달만으로 진입 확정하지 않음");}
 @Override protected void onResume(){super.onResume();active=true;handler.postDelayed(poll,12000);} final Runnable poll=new Runnable(){public void run(){if(active){refresh();handler.postDelayed(this,15000);}}};@Override protected void onPause(){super.onPause();active=false;handler.removeCallbacks(poll);}
 class Chart extends View {Paint p=new Paint(3);Chart(Context c){super(c);}void line(Canvas c,float x1,float y1,float x2,float y2,int color,float width){p.setColor(color);p.setStrokeWidth(width);c.drawLine(x1,y1,x2,y2,p);}void label(Canvas c,String s,float x,float y,int color){p.setColor(color);p.setTextSize(dp(11));c.drawText(s,x,y,p);}protected void onDraw(Canvas c){super.onDraw(c);int w=getWidth(),h=getHeight();c.drawColor(0xff0e192b);if(candles.size()<5)return;int count=Math.min(80,candles.size()),start=candles.size()-count;double hi=-1e100,lo=1e100;for(int i=start;i<candles.size();i++){hi=Math.max(hi,candles.get(i).h);lo=Math.min(lo,candles.get(i).l);}if(longP!=null){hi=Math.max(hi,Math.max(longP.tp2,shortP.sl));lo=Math.min(lo,Math.min(longP.sl,shortP.tp2));}double span=Math.max(1e-9,hi-lo);float top=dp(14),bottom=h-dp(23),height=bottom-top;for(int i=0;i<5;i++){float y=top+height*i/4;line(c,0,y,w,y,0xff25364e,1);}float bw=w/(float)count;for(int i=0;i<count;i++){Candle b=candles.get(start+i);float x=bw*(i+.5f),yH=(float)(top+(hi-b.h)/span*height),yL=(float)(top+(hi-b.l)/span*height),yO=(float)(top+(hi-b.o)/span*height),yC=(float)(top+(hi-b.c)/span*height);int color=b.c>=b.o?GREEN:RED;line(c,x,yH,x,yL,color,1);p.setColor(color);c.drawRect(x-Math.max(1,bw*.3f),Math.min(yO,yC),x+Math.max(1,bw*.3f),Math.max(yO+1,yC),p);}if(longP!=null){level(c,"LONG ENTRY",longP.entry,GREEN,hi,span,top,height);level(c,"LONG TP1",longP.tp1,0xff50b7ff,hi,span,top,height);level(c,"LONG SL",longP.sl,RED,hi,span,top,height);level(c,"SHORT ENTRY",shortP.entry,RED,hi,span,top,height);level(c,"SHORT TP1",shortP.tp1,0xff50b7ff,hi,span,top,height);level(c,"SHORT SL",shortP.sl,GOLD,hi,span,top,height);level(c,"LAST",lastPrice,WHITE,hi,span,top,height);}}void level(Canvas c,String name,double v,int color,double hi,double span,float top,float height){float y=(float)(top+(hi-v)/span*height);line(c,0,y,getWidth(),y,color,dp(1));label(c,name+" "+f(v),dp(5),Math.max(dp(12),y-dp(3)),color);}}
